      "description": "AI videos starring you.\n\nRecord one short clip and HeyGen builds your avatar: your face, your voice, on video whenever you need one. Type a script and your avatar delivers it on camera. Same you, no reshoots.\n\nWHO IT'S FOR\n- Real estate agents: a video for every listing\n- Founders and solopreneurs: show up on camera without filming every time\n- Finance professionals: market updates and client explainers in your own face and voice, at the pace the market moves\n- Health and wellness creators: daily tips, routines, and programs on camera without daily filming\n\nCREATE YOUR AVATAR\n- Record yourself: one short video captures your look, voice, and expressions\n- Build from photos: a lifelike avatar from a few pictures\n- Avatar 4, photo-to-video: one face photo becomes a natural talking video\n- Design with AI: describe a look and get a custom avatar\n- Not ready to be on camera? Pick from thousands of stock avatars and switch to yours later\n\nMAKE VIDEOS WITH IT\n- Text-to-video: paste a script, your avatar speaks it\n- Video Agent: a prompt and an image become a finished video with b-roll and motion graphics\n- Your voice or ours: record audio or use AI voices with lip-sync\n- Captions built for social\n- Instant Highlights: long-form links become short clips\n- Video Translation: 100+ languages, still looking and sounding like you\n\nTrusted by 80% of the Fortune 100.\n\nTerms of Use: https://www.heygen.com/terms\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.heygen.com/policy",
